ly empty evidence, findings, and follow-up arrays. It performed no actual validation. The deliverable is still sound, but the validation stage was a no-op.","Nit: The ASCII flow diagram (lines 33-57) does not show the microfauna consumption pathway as a separate entry. It shows 'periphyton or fine detritus → consumer ingestion' generically. Adding a microfauna line would improve visual completeness since microfauna have distinct routing characteristics (index-based approximation)."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Optional: Add a one-line clarifying note after line 63 that the equation is the top-level mass balance shorthand, and lines 64-65 define the actual two-tier implementation split.","Optional: Add a note to the RemoveShrimp row (line 148) that biomass export accounting is approximate until shrimp carry per-individual mass, similar to the microfauna caveat.","No blocking changes required. The document is complete, internally consistent, correctly cross-referenced, and meets all three acceptance criteria."],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"7224e6ce-2c79-465c-9cb8-1f80ad2ee936"}
